# interplay_dag_pressure: Pending-queue pressure inside a graph: the pressure FIFO (child 18) holds a faulted head (opcode 99) and 129 NOPs, so its thread blocks pushing the 128th NOP's stamp with 128 pending, and its two nodes wait behind them. Children 1 and 4 wait on its first node, and its second on child 3, whose chain with child 2 runs meanwhile. 0x1028 = 18 publishes the 128 in one interrupt, the last two NOPs one each, then the pressure FIFO's nodes and the ones waiting on them run.
